lementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-657701e elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"657701e\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-212b371\" data-id=\"212b371\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6d7f565 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"6d7f565\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><strong><a href=\"\/saudiarabia\/en\/services\/\">Services<\/a><\/strong> \/ Advising<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-536db28 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"536db28\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-4e8d365\" data-id=\"4e8d365\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-da85041 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"da85041\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Our &#8216;Advising&#8217; services are designed to align with the Saudi Capital Market Authority (CMA) standards, offering expert advice on various aspects of securities. Our team of Investment Advisors is proficient in guiding clients through the intricacies of the financial market, ensuring they make informed decisions in their investment journey.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-72129cb elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"72129cb\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-b1db2ac\" data-id=\"b1db2ac\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0f341a9 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"0f341a9\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tKey Elements of Advising Services\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-89d2457\" data-id=\"89d2457\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3d0911c elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"3d0911c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><strong>Advising&nbsp;<\/strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 13pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Montserrat; border-width: 1pt; border-style: none; border-color: windowtext; padding: 0in;\">\u2013&nbsp;<\/span><\/strong><span style=\"background-color: rgb(0, 66, 122); font-family: Montserrat; font-size: 13pt;\">As a CMA licensed advisor, Arqaam Capital can<br>advise another person in relation to a security, which includes advising on the<br>merits of that person dealing in it, exercising any right to deal conferred by<br>it or in financial planning or wealth management advice. (Securities Business<br>Regulations, Chapter 1, Article 2).<\/span><\/p>\n<p><strong>1. Advising Security Merits<\/strong>: Providing in-depth analysis and recommendations on specific securities, highlighting their benefits and potential drawbacks.&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p><strong>2. Guidance: <\/strong>Offering strategic advice on executing transactions and trading of various securities, tailored to each client&#8217;s portfolio and investment goals.<strong>&nbsp;<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong>3. Rights Consultation<\/strong>: Advising clients in understanding and exercising their rights associated with securities, such as voting, conversion, or redemption rights.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Financial Planning<\/strong>: Advising clients develop comprehensive financial strategies that integrate their current and prospective securities holdings.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Wealth Management<\/strong>: Advising on broader wealth management services, including portfolio design, diversification strategies, and alignment with long-term financial objectives.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Risk Management<\/strong>: Advising on the potential risks associated with specific securities and their impact on the overall financial portfolio.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-a74e3e8 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"a74e3e8\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-35d0c75\" data-id=\"35d0c75\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f6e330c elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"f6e330c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tAdvising Business Line\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-e74c52b\" data-id=\"e74c52b\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-29cf514 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"29cf514\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tOur advising services extend to institutions and qualified clients, encompassing:\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1a4e076 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"1a4e076\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><b>Strategic Alternatives Analysis<\/b>: Offering insights into various strategic options for financial growth.<\/p><p><b>Securities Research<\/b>: Producing and disseminating research, initially by Arqaam Capital Limited (DIFC), approved and issued in KSA by Arqaam Capital Financial (KSA).<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-28bdd09 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"28bdd09\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-7e1ca8f\" data-id=\"7e1ca8f\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4835163 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"4835163\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tCapital Markets Advisory\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-b5d5aec\" data-id=\"b5d5aec\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-73d2432 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"73d2432\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tArqaam Capital specializes in advising and arranging services to help companies and governments raise capital through:\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-de11a3e elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"de11a3e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><strong>Equity Capital Markets<\/strong>: Services for initial public offerings (IPOs), pre-IPO equity raises, secondary placings, and rights offerings.<br \/><br \/><b>Debt Capital Markets<\/b>: Expertise in the issuance of bonds, sukuks, perpetual bonds, and structured debt.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-045cff1 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"045cff1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tAs financial advisers, bookrunners, issue lead managers, and arrangers, we provide:\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e96a446 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"e96a446\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><strong>Transaction Feasibility Analysis<\/strong>: Business, financial, and transactional assessments.<br \/><br \/><b>Strategic Transaction Advice<\/b>: Guidance on exchange selection, transaction timing, structure, and terms.<br \/><br \/><b>Professional Adviser Recommendations<\/b>: Assisting in choosing legal and other advisers.<br \/><br \/><b>Marketing Material and Memoranda Assistance<\/b>: Support in drafting key transaction documents.<br \/><br \/><b>Investor Identification and Bookbuilding<\/b>: Identifying potential investors and managing the bookbuilding process.<br \/><br \/><b>Investor Roadshow Support<\/b>: Assisting in investor roadshow planning and execution.<br \/><br \/><b>Syndicate Coordination<\/b>: Leading and coordinating the syndicate of financial institutions involved.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-07b2662 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"07b2662\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tAt Arqaam Capital, our &#8216;Advising&#8217; services are an embodiment of our commitment to providing our clients with comprehensive, customized, and strategic financial advice, ensuring their investment decisions are well-informed and aligned with their financial aspirations.\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t